h_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119598.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-29T15:56:07Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #119597\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis fixes the issue by running `detect_signed()` on the whole image before saving it as compressed textures, and then passing in the signedness as a parameter to `Image::_compress_from_channels()`\r\n\r\nI added `Image::_compress_from_channels()` to the Image class for this because I did not want to modify the public API and I don't think it's necessary for the BPTC option functionality to be exposed; let me know if you want me to modify `compress()` to expose that.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119598/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119598/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}